--- !u!114 &1337994447
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1337994443}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 20e38534231d217449f4fbd1756c98a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _dialogPanel: {fileID: 1633516744}
  _portraitImage: {fileID: 1604861150}
  _nameText: {fileID: 814065171}
  _dialogText: {fileID: 389176673}
  _typingSpeed: 0.03
  _introPlayerPrefsKey: HasSeenIntro
  _introDialogLines:
  - CharacterName: Colt Vane
    CharacterPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 701058b2fcdd1e341b5b2f8b46e6da1a,
      type: 3}
    Text: Wake up, greenhorn! Name's Colt Vane. I ride this iron beast through hell,
      but I can't drive and shoot all these bastard machines at once!
  - CharacterName: Colt Vane
    CharacterPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 701058b2fcdd1e341b5b2f8b46e6da1a,
      type: 3}
    Text: Welcome to the Wastes. It's just us, miles of burning rust, and a bunch
      of rogue tin cans trying to scrap my train. You want to live? Pick up a gun!
  - CharacterName: Colt Vane
    CharacterPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 701058b2fcdd1e341b5b2f8b46e6da1a,
      type: 3}
    Text: Man those turrets and blow everything that moves back to scrap metal. Protect
      my core, and maybe we'll grab a cold drink at the next station!
  _stationDialogs:
  - Title: Station 1 - Rust Outpost
    Lines:
    - CharacterName: Colt Vane
      CharacterPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 701058b2fcdd1e341b5b2f8b46e6da1a,
        type: 3}
      Text: Not bad for a rookie! We made it in one piece, but those iron bastards
        dented my hull. Fix the turrets, patch up the armor, and let's get moving
        before more show up!
